flowchart TD
    A[Request] --> B[Validate]
    B --> C[Detect and analyze context]
    C --> D[Deterministic policy]
    D --> E{Outcome}
    E -->|ALLOW| F[Audit metadata]
    F --> G[Provider permit]
    G --> H[Provider adapter]
    E -->|REDACT| I[Redact]
    I --> J[Re-detect and verify]
    J --> K{Verified?}
    K -->|No| Z[Fail closed]
    K -->|Yes| L[Audit metadata]
    L --> M[Provider permit]
    M --> H
    E -->|BLOCK| N[Block response; zero provider calls]
    E -->|REVIEW| O[Pending review; zero provider calls]
    C -. error .-> Z
    D -. error .-> Z
